* Vintage Sowter scan, main assembly. Terminal order follows the numbered edge.
* Test assumptions and component-source differences are in reference/SPICE.md.
* mode 0=C, 1=L, 2=OFF. Vintage drawing has no separate bypass relay.
* Pots normalized positions. IN tracks signal into the detector input.
.subckt COMP525C chassis out_hi out_lo edge4 in_hi in_low stereo_in defeat test lamp_hi lamp_lo vp_ext com vn_ext
+ params: inp=.5 outp=.75 ceiling_index=5 r1pos=0 r2pos=0 mode=0 ds=0
+ gaintrim=.22 limittrim=.3 overridetrim=.5 metertrim=.5
.param rdopen=1e12 rdclosed=.02
.func sw(on) {ternary_fcn(on,rdclosed,rdopen)}
.func segment(total,p) {max(1u,total*p)}
* Connector pins 4 and 6 are strapped in the drawing. V elements represent ties.
Vedge4 edge4 in_low 0
R1 in_hi test 10k
R2 test a1_plus 180
R3 a1_plus in_low 120
R4 linear_ac fet_gate 39k
R5 fet_gate detector_control 39k
R7 a1_minus a1_out {segment(4700,gaintrim)}
C1 a1_minus fet_drain 250u
C2 linear_drive linear_ac .1u
C3 detector_control in_low .1u
C20 a1_minus a1_out 150p
JQ1 fet_drain fet_gate in_low A525_VCR2N
Q5 neg_rail q5_base linear_drive A525_2N5087
R78 a1_plus q5_base 1k
R79 linear_drive pos_rail 10k
XA1 a1_plus a1_minus a1_out pos_rail neg_rail in_low ACTIVE_DOA
* The input/link return and source are on pins 7 and 8, in parallel with R63.
Vedge8 defeat a1_out 0
R63 defeat stereo_in 150
R43a stereo_in in_pot_wiper {segment(1000,1-inp)}
R43b in_pot_wiper in_low {segment(1000,inp)}
R38a a1_out out_pot_wiper {segment(1000,1-outp)}
R38b out_pot_wiper in_low {segment(1000,outp)}
* Both physical ladder decks, with one selected contact each (0 through 10).
R9 ca_2 ca_4 47k
R10 ca_4 ca_6 16k
R11 ca_6 ca_8 9.1k
R12 ca_8 ca_10 5.6k
R13 ca_10 ca_12 3.9k
R14 ca_12 ca_14 2.7k
R15 ca_14 ca_16 1.8k
R16 ca_16 ca_18 1.5k
R17 ca_18 in_pot_wiper 1.2k
RS5A0 a3_plus in_low {sw(ceiling_index==0)}
RS5A2 a3_plus ca_2 {sw(ceiling_index==1)}
RS5A4 a3_plus ca_4 {sw(ceiling_index==2)}
RS5A6 a3_plus ca_6 {sw(ceiling_index==3)}
RS5A8 a3_plus ca_8 {sw(ceiling_index==4)}
RS5A10 a3_plus ca_10 {sw(ceiling_index==5)}
RS5A12 a3_plus ca_12 {sw(ceiling_index==6)}
RS5A14 a3_plus ca_14 {sw(ceiling_index==7)}
RS5A16 a3_plus ca_16 {sw(ceiling_index==8)}
RS5A18 a3_plus ca_18 {sw(ceiling_index==9)}
RS5A20 a3_plus in_pot_wiper {sw(ceiling_index==10)}
R28 cb_0 cb_2 8.2k
R29 cb_2 cb_4 6.8k
R30 cb_4 cb_6 5.1k
R31 cb_6 cb_8 4.3k
R32 cb_8 cb_10 3.3k
R33 cb_10 cb_12 2.7k
R34 cb_12 cb_14 2.2k
R35 cb_14 cb_16 1.6k
R36 cb_16 cb_18 1.3k
R37 cb_18 cb_20 1.1k
RS5B0 out_pot_wiper cb_0 {sw(ceiling_index==0)}
RS5B2 out_pot_wiper cb_2 {sw(ceiling_index==1)}
RS5B4 out_pot_wiper cb_4 {sw(ceiling_index==2)}
RS5B6 out_pot_wiper cb_6 {sw(ceiling_index==3)}
RS5B8 out_pot_wiper cb_8 {sw(ceiling_index==4)}
RS5B10 out_pot_wiper cb_10 {sw(ceiling_index==5)}
RS5B12 out_pot_wiper cb_12 {sw(ceiling_index==6)}
RS5B14 out_pot_wiper cb_14 {sw(ceiling_index==7)}
RS5B16 out_pot_wiper cb_16 {sw(ceiling_index==8)}
RS5B18 out_pot_wiper cb_18 {sw(ceiling_index==9)}
RS5B20 out_pot_wiper cb_20 {sw(ceiling_index==10)}
R64 cb_20 in_low 3.3k
* S1A: audio through output stage in OFF via factory test tap.
RS1A13 meter_sw_feedback meter_mode_common {sw(mode!=2)}
RS1A24 cb_20 a2_input_ac {sw(mode!=2)}
RS1A46 a2_input_ac test {sw(mode==2)}
RS1A810 lamp_switch lamp_lo {sw(mode!=2)}
RDS1 lamp_switch lamp_join 85
RDS2 lamp_join lamp_hi 85
RM1 meter_mode_common in_low 650
C5 a2_plus a2_input_ac 5u
R39 a2_plus in_low 62k
C6 a2_plus in_low 47p
R40 a2_minus a2_fb_ac 1k
C7 a2_fb_ac in_low 33u
R41 a2_minus a2_out 20k
C8 a2_minus a2_out 47p
XA2 a2_plus a2_minus a2_out pos_rail neg_rail in_low ACTIVE_DOA
XT1 a2_out in_low out_hi t1_sjoin out_lo T525C_OUT
* S1B Limit bank. Common side A also sees R18 in the drawing.
R18 a3_plus s1b_common_a 82k
RS1B13 a3_plus s1b_common_a {sw(mode!=1)}
RS1B35 s1b_common_a in_pot_wiper {sw(mode==1)}
RS1B46 s1b_common_b a3_fb_out {sw(mode==1)}
R72 pos_rail limit_upper 3.9k
R73 neg_rail limit_lower 2.7k
R74 limit_rect s1b_common_b 200
R75 limit_upper limit_lower {segment(2000,limittrim)}
C17 limit_upper com 33u
C18 com limit_lower 33u
DCR7 limit_rect limit_upper A525_RECT
DCR8 limit_lower limit_rect A525_RECT
* S1C Comp contact shorts R19 at the normal junction when pressed.
RS1C35 a3_minus deess_mode_return {sw(mode==0)}
R44 deess_mode_return s1c_bottom_b 200
C9 s1c_bottom_b in_low 320u
* S4 D-S alters A3 feedback and switches in a low-frequency shunt branch.
RS4A a3_minus a3_fb_mid {sw(ds==0)}
RS4B deess_mode_return s4_lower_b {sw(ds==1)}
R19 a3_minus deess_mode_return 200
R45 deess_ac s4_lower_b 51
C10 deess_ac in_low .33u
R47 a3_minus a3_fb_mid 75k
C11 a3_minus a3_fb_mid .033u
R46 a3_fb_mid a3_fb_out 100k
R71 a3_out a3_fb_out 1k
R65 a3_plus in_low 3.9k
XA3 a3_plus a3_minus a3_out pos_rail neg_rail com ACTIVE_DOA
XT2 a3_out in_low t2_high in_low t2_low T525C_DETECTOR
* Detector, release override and meter rectifier.
R76 t2_high release_rect_hi 2.7k
C13 release_rect_hi in_low .1u
R77 release_rect_lo t2_low 2.7k
C14 in_low release_rect_lo .1u
DCR1 release_rect release_rect_hi A525_RECT
DCR2 release_rect release_rect_lo A525_RECT
DCR3 t2_high meter_rect A525_RECT
DCR4 t2_low meter_rect A525_RECT
DCR11 detector_control t2_high A525_RECT
DCR12 detector_control t2_low A525_RECT
R50 detector_control override_ac 910k
DCR5 override_bias override_ac A525_RECT
R51 neg_rail override_bias 16k
R52 override_bias in_low {segment(47000,overridetrim)}
R53 meter_rect meter_trim_top 500
C12 meter_trim_top in_low 5u
R55a meter_trim_top meter_trim_wiper {segment(10000,1-metertrim)}
R55b meter_trim_wiper in_low {segment(10000,metertrim)}
R68 meter_sw_feedback meter_clamp_top 1.5k
R54 meter_clamp_top meter_trim_wiper 7.5k
DCR6 meter_trim_wiper meter_clamp_top A525_RECT
* REL buttons shunt the respective ladder paths.
R48 release_rect q2_base 1k
R70 q2_base in_low 5.6k
Q2 in_low q2_base q4_base A525_2N5087
Q4 release_time_sw q4_base q4_emitter A525_2N5087
R49 q4_emitter in_low 47k
R56 neg_rail release_bias_ac 1k
C19 q4_base release_bias_ac 10u
R57 neg_rail q4_base 100k
R58 q4_base in_low 10k
R59 release_time_sw release_series_mid 15meg
R66 release_series_mid q4_emitter 15meg
C21 in_low q4_emitter 22u
R61 detector_control rel_mid_tap 4.7meg
R62 rel_mid_tap rel_slow_tap 20meg
R60 rel_slow_tap release_time_sw 1meg
RS2 detector_control rel_mid_tap {sw(r1pos==0)}
RS3A rel_mid_tap rel_slow_tap {sw(r2pos==0)}
RS3B rel_slow_tap release_time_sw {sw(r2pos==1)}
* On-board reverse protection and reservoir capacitors remain in circuit.
DCR9 vp_ext pos_rail A525_SUPPLY
DCR10 neg_rail vn_ext A525_SUPPLY
C15 in_low neg_rail 10u
C16 pos_rail in_low 10u
.ends COMP525C
